# combat: the saved game, the party put next to the monster group of cell 436 (level 1); attacks with the hand under
# the keyboard cursor, the monsters answering. `poke` writes a word of DGROUP (the party's cell and facing).
option save fixtures/EOBDATA.SAV
idle
mark load
key ENTER
idle
poke FBCA 468
poke FBCC 0
poke 7294 1
idle
shot start
mark attack
key u
shot a1
key u
key u
key u
shot a2
key s
key u
key u
key u
key u
shot a3
key z
key u
key u
key u
key u
shot a4
mark sidestep
key LEFT
key RIGHT
shot end
idle
quit
